# The Ravager's end and the way to Malachor V (TSL, 851NIH, 205TEL,
# 907MAL, to 901MAL): the maintenance bay's missile bay control (851com:
# the launch sequence activated, the emergency override, a_global_set
# 851NIH_Missile_Bay 1), the missile's proton core taken (851mis:
# 851NIH_Missile_Bay 2, 851NIH_Bomb_Ravager 2), the last core set at bomb
# site 3 (851dem E8: "That's the last of them", 851NIH_Bomb_Ravager 3), out
# by the boarding hall (tr_222esc's 222tel: leave for good, a_escape_851:
# MalMov05). Revan light (101PER_Revan_End 0): Citadel Station, Grenn and
# Admiral Onasi (205TEL's carthend, from tr_carth at the entry: Revan's
# sake, "Safe journey, exile", Bastila's scene), its end (EndConversation
# a_901jump: TelMov02, HypMov01, MalMov07, MalMov08, 907MAL_CUTSCENE 2),
# Traya and Sion in the Trayus Core (907MAL's krecut1), and the Ebon Hawk
# down on Malachor V's surface (a_kreiacut: 901MAL), the Exile alone.
# Starts from the bridge's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @ravager_escape data/routes/tsl/ravager_escape.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Ravager - Bridge" (its end) and "Malachor V -
# Endgame" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/); Kerbow [WRAVDN]; GameBanshee 57-58.
#
# ASSUMES:
#   852NIH_Nihilus_Dead 1, 851NIH_Bomb_Ravager 1 (three cores set, one lost:
#   the command deck's route); the party Mandalore and Visas.
#   Revan a man (c_chkrevsex: the "him" replies) and light
#   (101PER_Revan_End 0, a_setrevangood: 205TEL, not straight to 907MAL).
#   The Exile is male (Grenn's "sir", c_ismale).
say Activate the launch sequence. # 851com (R1 needs 851NIH_Missile_Bay 0)
say Override the emergency sequence. # E2 (E3's warning only while
say Log out.         # 851NIH_Bomb_Ravager is 0)
use 851com           # the missile bay control by the workbench
say Remove the proton core. # 851mis start 1
use 851mis           # the missile
say Set one of the proton cores # 851dem start 1, E8: the last of them
say We're out of here. Expect us soon. # R15 (852NIH_Nihilus_Dead 1)
to tr_851dem@3       # bomb site 3, the lower hallway's dead end (mn_bomb3)
talk
fight 30
say Leave the Ravager for good. # 222tel start 0 (Nihilus dead, cores > 2)
to tr_222esc         # the boarding hall: the shuttle
talk                 # a_escape_851: MalMov05
if in 205tel         # Citadel Station: Grenn and Admiral Onasi (tr_carth)
say Very well. Lead on.
say Grenn said you wanted to speak to me about a mutual acquaintance.
say Did you know him?
say =Why?            # (not "Why did he ask that?", offered later)
say You cannot give up hope.
say Why did he ask that?
say How did you know Revan?
say Revan's ship?
say Do you want me to tell you what I find?
talk                 # carthend; "Safe journey, exile", Bastila
end
module 907mal        # a_901jump's movies; Traya and Sion (k_907_enter)
talk                 # krecut1: Sion crushed; a_kreiacut: 901MAL
module 901mal        # the Ebon Hawk down, the Exile alone (k_901mal_enter)
save malachor_surface
